WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.100
Click the Web search button in the composer. Searches go through the private, bundled SearXNG.

2
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.900
Ask a question the web can answer.

3
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:12.400
The answer arrives with the web pages it used.

4
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.200
Expand Web sources to see and open every page it cited.
